            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Don't worry, though. This can be dealt with easily enough. You simply need to speak with Dworgyn, in Nightside, and see if he can find you a suitable bone.",
